<h1>Property Tax Levies</h1>
<p>Issues 4 through 40 include 36 property-tax levies. Issue 10 is the Conneaut charter amendment, not a levy.</p>

<span class="verification-badge">Levy jurisdictions, types, and rates checked against the county auditor on 2026-10-11</span>
<p>Millage is a tax rate, not the dollar amount your household will pay. The dollar impact, term, and exact wording can vary by parcel and by issue. Use the official sources below and confirm your own precinct ballot before deciding.</p>

<h2>Tax changes (11)</h2>
<p>These are new taxes, increases, or a reduction. The rest are straight renewals.</p>

<table class="levies">
  <thead>
    <tr><th>Issue</th><th>Jurisdiction</th><th>Purpose</th><th>Type</th><th>Millage</th><th></th></tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    {% for levy in levies %}
    {% if levy.tax_change %}
    <tr>
      <td>{{ levy.issue_number }}</td>
      <td>{{ levy.jurisdiction }}</td>
      <td>{{ levy.purpose }}</td>
      <td>{{ levy.type }}</td>
      <td>{{ levy.millage }}</td>
      <td><input type="checkbox" data-worksheet-id="levy-{{ levy.issue_number }}-yes" data-worksheet-label="Issue {{ levy.issue_number }} ({{ levy.jurisdiction }} {{ levy.purpose }}): YES" aria-label="Vote yes on Issue {{ levy.issue_number }}"></td>
    </tr>
    {% endif %}
    {% endfor %}
  </tbody>
</table>

<h2>Straight renewals (25)</h2>
<p>These continue existing taxes at the same rate. They do not add a new levy or change the levy rate.</p>

<table class="levies">
  <thead>
    <tr><th>Issue</th><th>Jurisdiction</th><th>Purpose</th><th>Millage</th><th>Rate</th></tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    {% for levy in levies %}
    {% if not levy.tax_change %}
    <tr>
      <td>{{ levy.issue_number }}</td>
      <td>{{ levy.jurisdiction }}</td>
      <td>{{ levy.purpose }}</td>
      <td>{{ levy.millage }}</td>
      <td>{{ levy.millage }}</td>
    </tr>
    {% endif %}
    {% endfor %}
  </tbody>
</table>

